<section id="faq" class="card" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
  <div class="card-header">
    <h2 id="faq-heading">Contact FAQs</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="card-body">
    <h3 class="h5">Do I have to schedule a demo to try GatherPack?</h3>
    <p>No. Self-hosters can clone <a href="https://github.com/GatherPack/gatherpack" target="_blank" rel="noopener">the repo</a> and try locally; others can book a <a href="https://cal.com/sledgehammer/gatherpack-discussion-demo" target="_blank" rel="noopener">15-minute demo</a> with qualifying info already in hand.</p>
    <h3 class="h5">How do you handle FIRST discounts?</h3>
    <p>At cost, more or less — contact for the current FIRST rate rather than a stale public number. <a href="/hosting/#first-discount">Details</a></p>
    <p class="mb-0"><a href="/faq/">All FAQs →</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

